# The files that judge every change: the checks, the scripts they run and the settings they run
# under. A pull request that touches one needs the owner's review.
#
# This file does nothing by itself. It takes effect with a branch rule on main:
# Settings > Rules (or Branches) > require a pull request, and "Require review from Code Owners".
# An admin can still merge past it, which then takes a deliberate click.

/tests/architecture.*          @LemonPhase
/scripts/rules-from-base.mjs   @LemonPhase
/scripts/trace.mjs             @LemonPhase
/scripts/e2e.mjs               @LemonPhase
/.github/                      @LemonPhase
/eslint.config.js              @LemonPhase
/tsconfig.json                 @LemonPhase
/tsconfig.node.json            @LemonPhase
/vite.config.ts                @LemonPhase
/package.json                  @LemonPhase
/AGENTS.md                     @LemonPhase
